<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain cuts daily rate by 50 bps to 6.35pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain cuts daily rate by 50 bps to 6.35pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said it injected 312 billion pesetas in three day money market funds at an average 6.35 percent, against 6.85 percent on Thursday.</p>
<p>It reduced the daily rate after earlier this morning it had announced a 50 basis points reduction in its repo rate to 6.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
